Version 1.2 (October 2015, Florian Maushart)

- Restructured the code to make it correspond better to the Webots version

Version 1.1 (November 2009, Florian Vaussard)

- Com-module lib updated for the latest version of the turret's firmware (using TinyOS 2.1)
- Not using the e_robot_id lib anymore, use the turret's id instead
- Improved wall following (the robot turns immediatly when it changes its decision) and improved robot-user interaction
- Sensors callibration at startup + storage in EEPROM

Version 1.0 (???, Christopher Cianci)

- First release

